**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.hypothesis
**/.benchmarks
**/node_modules
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate*
**/.env
**/.env.*
